{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2022-12-01 12:00:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER STEVE TOMSIC TO PARTICIPATE IN UPCOMING UBS GLOBAL TMT CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES , DECEMBER 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER STEVE TOMSIC WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE UPCOMING UBS GLOBAL TMT CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, DECEMBER 5 AT APPROXIMATELY 10:00AM (EASTERN), 7:00AM (PACIFIC). A LIVE AND ARCHIVED WEBCAST OF THE PRESENTATION WILL BE AVAILABLE AT INVESTOR.FOXCORPORATION.COM.'}